# Environment variables used by the deploy scripts.
# Copy to .env and fill in when needed. Forge loads .env automatically.
# Never commit .env or a private key.

# --- DeployMainnet.s.sol only -------------------------------------------------
# Address that may call setPrices(). Defaults to the deployer.
# KEEPER=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
# Address that receives withdrawn USDC. Defaults to the deployer.
# TREASURY=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
# Comma separated xStock addresses. Defaults to TSLAx,NVDAx,SPYx (AAPLx has no
# Monad liquidity today). Max 8 entries, must be non-zero addresses.
# STOCKS=0x8aD3c73F833d3F9A523aB01476625F269aEB7Cf0,0xc845b2894dBddd03858fd2D643B4eF725fE0849d,0x90A2a4c76b5D8c0bc892A69EA28Aa775a8f2dD48
